{"item_uid": "學測91-math-001", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 91, "year_ce": 2002, "subject_key": "math", "subject_zh": "數學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 1, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "設P(x,y) 為坐標平面上一點，且滿足\n(x−1)2 +(y−2)2 + (x−3)2 +(y−4)2 = (3−1)2 +(4−2)2\n那麼P點的位置在哪裡？\n(1) 第一象限 (2) 第二象限\n(3) 第三象限 (4) 第四象限\n(5) x軸或y軸上", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "2", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測91-math-002", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 91, "year_ce": 2002, "subject_key": "math", "subject_zh": "數學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 2, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "一群登山友，在山上發現一顆巨樹，隊中10位身高170公分的男生，手拉著手剛好環抱大樹一\n圈。問樹幹的直徑最接近下列何值？\n(1) 3公尺 (2) 5公尺\n(3) 7公尺 (4) 9公尺\n(5) 11公尺", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "7", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測91-math-003", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 91, "year_ce": 2002, "subject_key": "math", "subject_zh": "數學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 3, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "如圖，下面哪一選項中的向量與另兩個向量 P O 、 Q O 之和等於零向量？\n(1) AO\n(2) D\nBO\nC E\n(3) CO\n(4) DO B\n(5) EO A\nO\nQ\nP\n-1-\n數學考科 第 2 頁\n共 7 頁", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測91-math-004", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 91, "year_ce": 2002, "subject_key": "math", "subject_zh": "數學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 4, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "若某校1000位學生的數學段考成績平均分數是65.24分，樣本標準差是5.24分，而且已知成績\n分佈呈現常態分配。試問全校約有多少人數學成績低於60分？\n(1) 約80人 (2) 約160人\n(3) 約240人 (4) 約320人\n(5) 約400人", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測91-math-005", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 91, "year_ce": 2002, "subject_key": "math", "subject_zh": "數學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 5, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "試問用下列哪一個函數的部分圖形來描述右圖較恰當？\n(1) (x-2)2-2 y\n(2) 2sin(x)+2\n(3) 2cos(x)\n(4) -0.5(x-2)2+4\n(5) 3–2x\n(0,1)\nx\n(1,0)", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測91-math-006", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 91, "year_ce": 2002, "subject_key": "math", "subject_zh": "數學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 6, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "在坐標平面上有一橢圓，它的長軸落在x軸上，短軸落在y軸上，長軸、短軸的長度分別為\n4、2。如圖所示，通過橢圓的中心O且與x軸夾角為45度的直線在第一象限跟橢圓相交於P。\n則此交點P與中心O的距離為\n(1) 1.5 y\n(2) 1.6 P\n(3) 2\n45 x\n(4) 2.5\nO\n(5) 3.2\n-2-\n第 3 頁 數學考科\n共 7 頁\n貳 、 多 重 選 擇 題", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測91-math-007", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 91, "year_ce": 2002, "subject_key": "math", "subject_zh": "數學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 8, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "一機器狗每秒鐘前進或者後退一步，程式設計師讓機器狗以前進3步，然後再後退2步的規律\n移動。如果將此機器狗放在數線的原點，面向正的方向，以1步的距離為1單位長。令P(n)表示\n第n秒時機器狗所在位置的坐標，且P(0)=0。那麼下列選項何者為真？\n(1) P(3)=3 (2) P(5)=1\n(3) P(10)=2 (4) P(101)=21\n(5) P(103)<P(104)\n2x+y+3z=0", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測91-math-008", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 91, "year_ce": 2002, "subject_key": "math", "subject_zh": "數學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 9, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "下列哪些選項與方程組 的解集合相同？\n4x+3y+6z=0\n2x+3z=0\n(1) y = 0 (2) \ny=0\n 1 3\nx+ y+ z=0\n(3) x = y = 0 (4)  2 2\n 4x+3y+6z=0\n6x+4y+9z=0\n(5) \n2x+y+3z=0\n\n10.觀察相關的函數圖形，判斷下列選項何者為真？\n(1) 10x=x 有實數解 (2) 10x=x2 有實數解\n(3) x 為實數時，10x>x 恆成立 (4) x>0 時，10x>x2恆成立\n(5) 10x= –x 有實數解\n-3-\n數學考科 第 4 頁\n共 7 頁", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測91-math-009", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 91, "year_ce": 2002, "subject_key": "math", "subject_zh": "數學", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 11, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "某甲自 89 年 7 月起，每月 1 日均存入銀行 1000 元，言明以月利率 0.5％按月複利計息，\n到90年7月1日提出。某乙則於89 年 7 月起，每單月(一月、三月、五月‧‧‧)1日均存入\n銀行2000元，亦以月利率0.5％按月複利計息，到90年7月1日提出。一整年中，兩人都存\n入本金12000元。提出時，甲得本利和A元，乙得本利和B元。問下列選項何者為真？\n121005 k\n(1) B>A (2) A=1000 ∑   \nk=1 1000 \n 6 1005 2k 1005 12\n(3) B=2000 ∑    (4) A<12000 \nk=1 1000  1000\n1005 12\n(5) B<12000 \n1000", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
